### 查询 FBA 入库资格预览
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/fba-inbound-eligibility/item-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "shopId": 1,
  "countryCode": "US",
  "query": {
    "asin": "B000000000",
    "program": "INBOUND",
    "marketplaceIds": "ATVPDKIKX0DER"
  }
}
